# Testing

- Domain logic (`features/*/domain/`) is tested next to the source: `calculate-standings.test.ts`.
- Test names describe behaviour in plain English: `"gives the goalkeeper and defenders a clean sheet when nothing is conceded"`.
- Cover edge cases from `DECISIONS.md`: draws, own goals, borrowed players, shared awards, absent goalkeepers, ties on points and goal difference.
- Server actions: test valid input, invalid input and a non-admin user.
- Component tests check behaviour (what the user sees and can do), not snapshots.
- Every bug fix includes a test that fails without the fix.
- Build test data with small factory functions (`buildFixture`, `buildGoal`), not large inline objects.
